  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Landsbygdsv&#xe4;gar &#xe5;teruppbyggnad, LSFRP I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia-Swedish Feeder Roads Project, LSFRP I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r att reducera fattigdomen genom att &#xf6;ppna tillg&#xe5;ngen till landsbygdsv&#xe4;gar f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jlig&#xf6;ra inkomster baserade p&#xe5; handel i synergi med andra givares st&#xf6;d till bl a jordbrukssektorn. Reparations&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rderna fokuserar p&#xe5; Lofa och Bong counties. &#xc4;ven uppbyggnad av kapaciteten inom privat och offentlig sektor ing&#xe5;r i projeketet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to poverty reduction by provision of sustainable access combined with income generation through synergies with other donor interventions, primarily in the agriculture sector.Outputs.Rehab and maint of feeder roads in the counties of Lofa and Bong, Improved capacity in the public and private sectors,A foundation laid for Gov strategy and donor coordination for a nation wide rural roads</narrative>
  </description>
